Let's expand the powers for $
\left(\blueD{x^3}\right)^{\greenD{3}}=\purpleD{x^n}$.

$\begin{align}
\left(\blueD{x^3}\right)^{\greenD3}&=\underbrace{\blueD{x^3\cdot x^3 \cdot x^3}}_\greenD{\text{3 times}}
\\\\\\
&=\underbrace{
\underbrace{\blueD{x\cdot x \cdot x}}_\text{3 times}
\cdot \underbrace{\blueD{x\cdot x \cdot x}}_\text{3 times}
 \cdot \underbrace{\blueD{x\cdot x \cdot x}}_\text{3 times}}
_\greenD{\text{3 times}}
\\\\
&=\purpleD{\underbrace{x\cdot x\cdot x\cdot x\cdot  x\cdot  x\cdot  x\cdot  x\cdot  x}_{n\text{ times}}}
\\\\
\end{align}$
